<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>These lists represent the best gear obtainable before entering any raid. There are two sets, the first set representing the best available pre-raid gear before the release of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6738/siege-of-orgrimmar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Siege of Orgrimmar</span></a>, and one representing the best available pre-raid gear after <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6738/siege-of-orgrimmar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Siege of Orgrimmar</span></a> has released; along with its respective Celestial Dungeon items and <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a> reputation items - purchased with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. <br/>
<br/>Keep in mind that achieving full "best-in-slot" gear for any given content phase is typically an unrealistic goal, particularly so for pre-raid lists, as you will usually enter raids long before obtaining all the listed items. As such, these lists are more of a guideline to aim for.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
<div class="tabs-wrapper exclude-units uniform-width">
<div id="dsf67g4d-bis-lists">
<div class="tabs-container">
<div class="tabs" role="tablist">
<button aria-selected="true" data-href="#bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" data-selected="true" role="tab" tabindex="0">
<div>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/achievement_jadeserpent.jpg");'></span>Pre-Raid Opening</div></button>
<button data-href="#bis-lists-soo-release" role="tab" tabindex="-1">
<div>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></span>SoO Release</div></button>
<div class="vertical-scroll-shadow"></div>
<div class="horizontal-scroll-shadow"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic (Phase 5) prior to <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6738/siege-of-orgrimmar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Siege of Orgrimmar</span></a> opening and Celestial Dungeons becoming available. This list allocates 1,600x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, 4,000x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, and 4,000x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> as the budget for purchasable items and will assume <span class="rep-neutral">Neutral</span> reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a>.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="exclude-units">
