<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-soo-release" role="tabpanel" style="display: none;" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall pre-raid gear available after the release of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6738/siege-of-orgrimmar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Siege of Orgrimmar</span></a> in Mists of Pandaria Classic (Phase 5), including the new Celestial Dungeon items. The Celestial versions of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6738/siege-of-orgrimmar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Siege of Orgrimmar</span></a> items will become available after the raid has released. This list has an unlimited <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, and <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> budget for purchasable items, will assume Friendly reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a>, and includes World Boss items. <br/>
