<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="celestial-dungeon-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Celestial Dungeon Gear for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available from Celestial Dungeons in Phase 5 of Mists of Pandaria Classic. Keep in mind that these items are likely to be replaced by their Normal and Heroic raid counterparts and will only become available after the release of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6738/siege-of-orgrimmar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Siege of Orgrimmar</span></a>. With that in mind, this is not a true "best in slot" list, and instead should serve as a rough guideline for what items from Celestial Dungeons to keep an eye on.<br/>
<br/>The Celestial Dungeon items that are lower item level variants of raid items <i>(and formerly would've been obtained from the LFR tool)</i> and can be purchased with the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=3350/august-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="August Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendarygem_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">August Stone Fragment</span></span></a> currency that is acquired by running these dungeons.<br/>
<br/>
