<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="heroic-dungeon-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/pvecurrency-valor.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Heroic Dungeon Gear for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Heroic dungeons, although it is very important to remember that because other gear may be obtained at a higher item level from raids, crafting, World Bosses, etc, it is not a true "best in slot" list but more of a rough guideline, and players should sim the gear they actually have available to them to determine their best combination of stats and effects. <br/>
<br/>Notably, the best weapon from heroic dungeons, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87542/mogudar-blade-of-the-thousand-slaves">
<img alt="Mogu'Dar, Blade of the Thousand Slaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mogu'Dar, Blade of the Thousand Slaves</span></a>, has an extremely low drop rate.<br/>
