<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria also includes several open world mobs and world bosses that also offer the chance to obtain powerful, high level epics. This includes Rare Mobs <i>("silver elites")</i> like <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50350/morgrinn-crackfang">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Morgrinn Crackfang</span></a>, but also World Bosses such as <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">Galleon &amp; Salyis' Warband</a> and the <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>Additionally, several valuable random world-drop Epics are Bind on Equip. These can be purchased off the Auction House if you have the gold to spare and aren't lucky enough to have one drop for you.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="celestials">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_monk_summontigerstatue.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Timeless Isle Celestials</span></h3>The <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=8535/celestial-challenge">Timeless Isle Celestials</a> are notable because they drop 553 item level Tier 16 legs and gloves, the same item level dropped in Normal difficulty Phase 5 raids; as well as various 550 item level Prideful Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a head start on your Tier &amp; PvP sets if you get lucky enough to obtain them:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99137/gauntlets-of-winged-triumph">
<img alt="Gauntlets of Winged Triumph" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_plate_raidpaladin_n_01glove.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gauntlets of Winged Triumph</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99139/legplates-of-winged-triumph">
<img alt="Legplates of Winged Triumph" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_plate_raidpaladin_n_01pant.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legplates of Winged Triumph</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_zandalaribabyraptorwhite.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>
<a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69161/oondasta">Oondasta</a> is a world boss that drops several notable 522 ilvl epics:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95192/belt-of-the-tyrannotitan">
