<img alt="Overcompensating Chain of the Alpha Male" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_121.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Overcompensating Chain of the Alpha Male</span></a></div></li>
