<img alt="Ring of King Kangrom" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_173.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of King Kangrom</span></a></div></li>
