<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95153/tyrant-king-battleplate">
<img alt="Tyrant King Battleplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tyrant King Battleplate</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95198/vulcanodon-gauntlets">
<img alt="Vulcanodon Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gloves_plate_raidwarrior_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vulcanodon Gauntlets</span></a></div></li></ul>The most notable item here is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95167/ring-of-king-kangrom">
<img alt="Ring of King Kangrom" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_173.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of King Kangrom</span></a> which was previously one of two pre-raid best-in-slot rings available outside of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6622/throne-of-thunder">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Throne of Thunder</span></a> in Phase 4.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="nalak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_holy_lightsgrace.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Nalak</span></h3>
<a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69099/nalak">Nalak</a> is another new world boss that has a loot table similar to Sha of Anger and drops Tier 15 legs &amp; gloves at the item level 522, which is the same item level acquired in Normal difficulty Phase 4 raid content, though these are slightly outdated at this point:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95281/lightning-emperors-gauntlets">
