<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, and can be upgraded to 530 iLvl without entering a raid.<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87072/lei-shens-final-orders">
<img alt="Lei Shen's Final Orders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lei Shen's Final Orders</span></a> was one of our best-in-slot trinkets in Phases 1-2, and is obtained from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6125/mogushan-vaults">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Mogu'shan Vaults</span></a>. It is slightly better than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87172/darkmist-vortex">
<img alt="Darkmist Vortex" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/creatureportrait_cyclone_nodebris.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmist Vortex</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87172/darkmist-vortex">
<img alt="Darkmist Vortex" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/creatureportrait_cyclone_nodebris.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmist Vortex</span></a> was one of our best-in-slot trinkets in Phases 1-2, and is obtained from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6067/terrace-of-endless-spring">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Terrace of Endless Spring</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79327/relic-of-xuen">
<img alt="Relic of Xuen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_tiger.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Xuen</span></a> is obtainable before entering any raids via the Darkmoon Faire <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79323/tiger-deck">
<img alt="Tiger Deck" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_deck_whitetiger.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tiger Deck</span></a> and can be upgraded to iLvl 484, making it pre-raid best-in-slot before the release of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6622/throne-of-thunder">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Throne of Thunder</span></a> and its respective Celestial trinkets.</div></li>[/<wbr/>ul]<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="hit-expertise">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_marksmanship.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reaching Hit and Expertise Cap for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>In Mists of Pandaria, the hit &amp; expertise caps will change slightly to 7.5% hit and 7.5% expertise when dealing damage against raid-level bosses. Keep in mind that some abilities such as the <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_human_female.gif");'></span>
<b>Human</b> racial passive <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=20597/sword-specialization">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_meleedamage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sword Specialization</span></a> will contribute to your overall hit and/<wbr/>or expertise, reducing the amount needed from gear &amp; reforging.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hit-rating">Hit Rating</h4>At 7.5% hit, our abilities and melee swings will no longer miss raid bosses <i>(+3 levels above you)</i>. When our attacks miss, we do not generate <a data-entity="resource" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/resource/holy-power-9">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Holy Power</span></a> or trigger <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=31801/seal-of-truth">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_sealofvengeance.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of Truth</span></a>, so it is very important to be hit capped.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="expertise-rating">Expertise Rating</h4>At 7.5% expertise, our abilities and melee swings will no longer be dodged by raid bosses <i>(+3 levels above you)</i>. They can still parry our attacks if they are facing us, but we will almost always try to be behind them to avoid parries, as mobs cannot parry attacks from behind. When our attacks dodge or parry, we do not generate <a data-entity="resource" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/resource/holy-power-9">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Holy Power</span></a> or trigger <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=31801/seal-of-truth">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_sealofvengeance.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of Truth</span></a>, so it is very important to be expertise capped.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="gemming">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_uncut_purple.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Gemming for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>
<b>We will generally prioritize Haste until we reach 50% total Haste</b> - <i>a major breakpoint</i> - after which we will switch to gemming as much Mastery as possible. <br/>
<br/>Therefore we will primarily be using <span class="c4">Yellow</span>, <span class="c11">Orange</span>, or <span class="c3">Green</span> gems to complete our socket bonuses. It is generally worth going for every socket bonus, because we have strong haste &amp; mastery gems we can use for any specific color. We will also utilize mixed Hit &amp; Expertise gems whenever we need to reach our caps.<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="below-50-haste">Below 50% Haste:</h5>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="q9">Meta Gem</span>: <a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95346/capacitive-primal-diamond">
<img alt="Capacitive Primal Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendary_chimeraoffear.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Capacitive Primal Diamond</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76886/reverberating-primal-diamond">
<img alt="Reverberating Primal Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_metagem_cut.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reverberating Primal Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c4">Yellow Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76699/quick-suns-radiance">
<img alt="Quick Sun's Radiance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_yellow.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quick Sun's Radiance</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c11">Orange Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76667/wicked-vermilion-onyx">
<img alt="Wicked Vermilion Onyx" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_orange.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wicked Vermilion Onyx</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76669/fierce-vermilion-onyx">
<img alt="Fierce Vermilion Onyx" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_orange.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fierce Vermilion Onyx</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c9">Purple Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76684/etched-imperial-amethyst">
<img alt="Etched Imperial Amethyst" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_purple.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Etched Imperial Amethyst</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c3">Green Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76642/lightning-wild-jade">
<img alt="Lightning Wild Jade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_green.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Wild Jade</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="above-50-haste">Above 50% Haste:</h5>
